{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12174","headline":"美杨侍御清文见示 · 钱起","name":"美杨侍御清文见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伯牙道丧来，弦绝无人续。\n谁知绝唱後，更有难和曲。\n层峰与清流，逸势竞奔蹙。\n清文不出户，仿像皆在目。\n雾雪看满怀，兰荃坐盈掬。\n孤光碧潭月，一片崑仑玉。\n初见歌阳春，韶光变枯木。\n再见吟白雪，便觉云肃肃。\n则知造化源，方寸能展缩。\n斯文不易遇，清爽心岂足。\n愿言书诸绅，可以爲佩服。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}